# Row-six pair ranks with first coordinate 32

Each displacement product has two checked row-span expansions and a checked
identity pivot minor. Shared coordinate evaluations connect these ranks to
the original ATLAS matrices. Certificates are grouped in bounded batches.
Source context: Aschbacher–Smith A.3.12, printed pp.47–48;
Kleidman–Wilson (1988), pp.484–510. ATLAS attribution is in Janko4.Model.Data.
Witness tables are generated locally; all arithmetic is checked by Lean's kernel.
-/

